"{{keyMod}} emulator shortcuts are unavailable while that key is assigned to "
"Open Apple. Ctrl+0 through Ctrl+5 still select emulator speed."
msgstr ""
"Emulatorns kortkommandon med {{keyMod}} är inte tillgängliga när tangenten "
